  _title: Conjunto Habitacional
  _titleEn: Housing Project
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Construir moradia popular em escala reduz o d\xE9ficit habitacional
    e tira fam\xEDlias de \xE1reas de risco."
  _summaryEn: Building affordable housing at scale reduces the housing shortage and
    moves families out of risk areas.
  _realWorld: "O programa Minha Casa, Minha Vida, lan\xE7ado em 2009, financiou milh\xF5es
    de moradias no Brasil."
  _realWorldEn: Brazil's Minha Casa, Minha Vida program, launched in 2009, financed
    millions of homes.
  _tradeOffs: "Conjuntos longe do centro, sem emprego, transporte e servi\xE7os por
    perto, criam periferias isoladas."
  _tradeOffsEn: Projects far from the center, without nearby jobs, transport and
    services, create isolated outskirts.
